{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prison Escape Simulator: Dig Out Demo is an introduction to the dark and gritty prison life.<br>Maybe one day you\u2019ll get out of prison... but not in the demo!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Check if you could escape from prison.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Prison Escape Simulator: Dig Out, you play as a determined inmate dreaming of freedom. Dig through the dirt, search for clues in letters, and carefully analyze how deep and in which direction to dig. Every day behind bars is a battle for survival and finding clever ways to bend the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710390/extras/Prison_Gif_2_400px.gif?t=1747039727\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ways to survive in prison.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival in prison depends on trading with inmates and a corrupt guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In demo tool upgrades are limited, so you\u2019ll have to make do with what you have. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710390/extras/Prison_Gif_3_400px.gif?t=1747039727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the full version, you\u2019ll have access to the prison warehouse, where you can buy furniture, glow sticks, beautiful carpets, and even better toilets to remove sand faster\u2014but none of these are available in the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710390/extras/Prison_Gif_4_400px.gif?t=1747039727\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">So, will you survive behind bars and prepare for the grand escape?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The demo offers about an hour of fun, but if you\u2019re ready for the thrill of real risk\u2026 the full game awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710390/extras/Prison_Gif_1_400px.gif?t=1747039727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3710390?t=1747039727","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710390/1599554b46db84ec2330579a96d63f331f4cf84c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747039727","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710390/791324caa8b964089edf85e702be3f92f3139f41/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747039727","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710390/791324caa8b964089edf85e702be3f92f3139f41/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747039727","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prison Escape Simulator: Dig Out Demo is an introduction to the dark and gritty prison life.<br>Maybe one day you\u2019ll get out of prison... but not in the demo!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Check if you could escape from prison.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Prison Escape Simulator: Dig Out, you play as a determined inmate dreaming of freedom. Dig through the dirt, search for clues in letters, and carefully analyze how deep and in which direction to dig. Every day behind bars is a battle for survival and finding clever ways to bend the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710390/extras/Prison_Gif_2_400px.gif?t=1747039727\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ways to survive in prison.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival in prison depends on trading with inmates and a corrupt guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In demo tool upgrades are limited, so you\u2019ll have to make do with what you have. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710390/extras/Prison_Gif_3_400px.gif?t=1747039727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the full version, you\u2019ll have access to the prison warehouse, where you can buy furniture, glow sticks, beautiful carpets, and even better toilets to remove sand faster\u2014but none of these are available in the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710390/extras/Prison_Gif_4_400px.gif?t=1747039727\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">So, will you survive behind bars and prepare for the grand escape?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The demo offers about an hour of fun, but if you\u2019re ready for the thrill of real risk\u2026 the full game awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710390/extras/Prison_Gif_1_400px.gif?t=1747039727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Digital Melody"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3672720","name":"Prison Escape Simulator: Dig Out"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710390/13314c9a040b5ef2defe9d5e00e5248c912c1892/header.jpg?t=1747039727","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"